tion_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/deployments","created_at":"2026-01-19T08:04:53Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T09:05:37Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-06T10:42:39Z","git_url":"git://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:m2ux/workflow-server.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server","homepage":"","size":68920,"stargazers_count":2,"watchers_count":2,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":127,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":1,"open_issues":127,"watchers":2,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"body":"## Overview\n\nPlan Mode publishes a new epic for an existing initiative, saves its parent row with the created identity, and validates fresh saved context before delivery preparation.\n\n## Problem\n\nThe [publication procedure](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/3223aee0e83766bf9ef5727662ce3626115a27ae/skills/work-planner/modes/plan-mode.md#L68-L85) places epic creation and identity replacement under the new-initiative branch. The existing-initiative route reaches validation without an explicit save of its new epic or the parent's new row. The ambiguity predates the style migration.\n\n## Proposal\n\nInitiative creation is conditional; epic publication and confirmed identity substitution serve both new and existing parents. Plan Mode owns the sequencing and calls the existing save/readback capabilities. Fresh issue identities and bodies supply format, goal and dependency validation. Failed saves stop downstream preparation with their evidence.\n\n## Work Breakdown\n\n| Task | Description | Coverage | Depends on | Joins | Lane | Done |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [W01](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-1641-integration-review/e05-w01.md) | Confirm epic and parent publication sequence | AC1, AC2, AC3 | [E01:W08](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/issues/1616) | | | |\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] **AC1.** Planning a new epic under an existing initiative saves the epic before validating saved context, as an ordered route fixture shows.\n- [ ] **AC2.** The parent Work Breakdown carries the saved epic identity and passes fresh saved-body and dependency checks, as a publication/readback fixture shows.\n- [ ] **AC3.** A failed issue save blocks delivery preparation with the failure evidence, as injected-failure route fixtures show.\n\n## References\n\n- **R1.** [Publication design](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-1641-integration-review/followups.md) — inherited source evidence, owning component and observing scenarios.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/issues/1655/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/issues/1655/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"content_type":"Issue","creator":{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-06T10:43:31Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T10:43:34Z","archive